{
  "name": "GD·03 Publish · on time",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## GD·03 Publish: on time (Boss 5 · D4)\nEvery 15 min: approved posts that are due → pause switch (posting_paused) → price RE-CHECK at publish time (held and Tolu notified if the price changed after approval) → route by platform:\n- Facebook: POST photo with message to the Page\n- Instagram: create media container, then publish\n- X: POST /2/tweets (pay per use: within the X budget, GD·00)\n- anything else (TikTok, LinkedIn until approved): sent to Tolu as a draft to post by hand\nEach returned post ID is saved; a failed post goes to the error workflow.\n\n**Credentials:** Postgres, Facebook Graph API (Page token with publish permissions), X OAuth2, Telegram.\n**Replace:** YOUR_PAGE_ID, YOUR_IG_USER_ID, YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "8d220f5c-3de1-4ec8-b3d2-b3db4201c5a0",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -528,
        -324
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "952df7d0-4c7e-44f4-be0d-7077e1b25c63",
      "name": "Every 15 minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT p.*, pr.price_ngn AS price_now, c.product_sku\nFROM posts p\nJOIN calendar c ON c.id = p.calendar_id\nLEFT JOIN products pr ON pr.sku = c.product_sku\nWHERE p.status = 'approved' AND p.scheduled_at <= now()\n  AND coalesce((SELECT value FROM settings WHERE key = 'posting_paused'), 'false') <> 'true'\nORDER BY p.scheduled_at LIMIT 20;",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "98162572-340b-423c-b731-a74e28b5d8c1",
      "name": "Due posts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
